        "falseColor": true,
        "notes": "The mapping team’s published color composite assigns the p, v and ul filters to red, green and blue. It includes near-infrared light and is not natural color. Global brightness and contrast were matched across observations, so these mosaic values are unsuitable for quantitative photometry. Local residual shadows remain."
