        "falseColor": false,
        "notes": "Images taken by Hayabusa2 during MASCOT deployment show boulders across Ryugu’s equatorial strip. The original sampling is about 28 cm per pixel; the display is coarser. Brightness includes the illumination when the photographs were taken. The grid marks gaps and the unobserved poles.",
